🤖 *AI SEO Recommendations - This Week*

🎯 *Priority Actions:*
{{ ($json.recommendations.priority_actions || []).map((a, i) => `${i+1}. ${a.action}\n   Impact: ${a.impact} | Effort: ${a.effort}`).join('\n') || 'No recommendations' }}

⚡ *Quick Wins (<1 hour):*
{{ ($json.recommendations.quick_wins || []).map((q, i) => `${i+1}. ${q}`).join('\n') || 'None' }}

📝 *Content Ideas:*
{{ ($json.recommendations.content_ideas || []).map((c, i) => `${i+1}. "${c.topic}" — Keyword: ${c.keyword || 'N/A'}\n   ${c.reason || ''}`).join('\n') || 'None' }}

🔧 *Technical Fixes:*
{{ ($json.recommendations.technical_fixes || []).map((t, i) => `${i+1}. ${t}`).join('\n') || 'None' }}

_Generated by AI based on last 7 days of SEO data_
